  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A pendulum of length <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"L\"></span> oscillates with an angular frequency <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\omega\"></span>. The mass of the pendulum is doubled and its length is changed to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{L}{4}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the new angular frequency of the pendulum?<br/><br/></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\omega}{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\omega\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2\\omega\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2\\sqrt{2\\omega}\"></span></li></ol>"
